   "depends_on": [],
   "why_here": {
    "zh": "★口径不对时，下游每一条比较量到的都是口径差，而不是物理差；两者在数上不可分辨。这是本册子把它排在第 0 位的唯一理由，与它简单不简单无关。",
    "en": "If conventions differ, every downstream comparison measures the convention gap rather than physics, and the two are numerically indistinguishable."
   },
